{
  "_comment": [
    "Agent config for a laptop running the ionozond sounder (Yoshkar-Ola).",
    "Copy it to the station and point AGENT_CONFIG at it, as for DOB:",
    "",
    "  scp deploy/station-ionozond.json.example samsung@<laptop>:~/agent.json",
    "  # edit server_url and live_dir, then:",
    "  AGENT_TOKEN=... AGENT_CONFIG=~/agent.json python3 -m services.agent live",
    "",
    "live_dir is the sounder's data_dir: the folder holding one",
    "YYYY.MM.DD folder per day of captures. live_unit is the unit whose",
    "journal carries its STATUS lines. Install services/agent/systemd/",
    "chirp-live.service to run the feed for good; it reads the token from",
    "/etc/default/chirp-agent like the health agent does.",
    "",
    "The feed needs numpy, which the sounder's own python3 already has.",
    "",
    "target is what Start and Stop act on, from /ui/live and the console.",
    "Neither works until polkit lets samsung run systemctl start, stop and",
    "restart on this one unit: deploy/README.md, 'An ionozond station'.",
    "no_block acknowledges them once systemd accepts them: a stop waits for",
    "the sounding in progress, up to 300 s, longer than the agent would.",
    "",
    "With live_dir set and no chirpsounder2 ini on the laptop, health reports",
    "the ages of the newest .lfp and .h5 and the sounder's last STATUS in",
    "place of chirpsounder2's products, band, ringbuffer and epoch offset.",
    "",
    "job_units is empty because ionozond-prune and ionozond-nas are installed",
    "disabled; list their .service units once their timers are enabled.",
    "unit_source_dir is empty because this repo's units are DOB's: its",
    "chirp-agent.service, installed here edited for samsung, would read as",
    "drift.",
    "",
    "sounder_defaults is the sounder unit's EnvironmentFile, read for",
    "IONOZOND_CONFIG, the chirp_config.py the sounder is handed. A",
    "schedule change from /ui/live edits the Qt console's schedule.ini and",
    "config.ini in console_settings and regenerates that file; it needs",
    "the health loop running too: deploy/README.md, 'the health loop'."
  ],
  "station": "yoshkar-ola",
  "server_url": "http://<server>:8000",
  "token": "",
  "target": "ionozond-sounder.service",
  "no_block": true,
  "units": ["ionozond-sounder.service"],
  "optional_units": [],
  "job_units": [],
  "unit_source_dir": "",
  "live_dir": "/home/samsung/ionozond_data",
  "live_unit": "ionozond-sounder.service",
  "live_window": 16384,
  "live_interval_s": 2.0,
  "sounder_defaults": "/etc/default/ionozond",
  "console_settings": "/home/samsung/.config/dsChirp"
}
